SUMMARY:An Evening with a Bhakti Yoga Master
DESCRIPTION:Join us in welcoming Balakhilya das\, world renowned Bhakti Yoga Master\, who offers a practical and accessible approach to Bhakti yoga\, focusing on kirtan\, the heart and soul of yoga. \nIn 1971\, Balakhilya das met his Spiritual Masters. Under their expert guidance\, he received and followed the ancient wisdom of Bhakti Yoga and continues to do so until this day. Join this world-renowned yogi for a special one-night-only gathering as he shares this beautiful and fulfilling journey. \nCHANT ✨ EXPERIENCE ✨ CONNECT \nNo yoga mat is needed for this event | Free of charge | Donations happily accepted to cover expenses\nEveryone welcome | Light refreshments served \nEvent Date: Wed July 8th\, 6:30pm\nEvent address: Davis Community Church\, 412 C St in the Fireside Room \nParking: If street parking at the church is full\, there is additional parking a short walk away at the corner of C and 5th (the parking lot for the Davis Joint Unified School District).
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/an-evening-with-a-bhakti-yoga-master/
LOCATION:Davis Community Church\, 412 C Street\, Davis\, ca\, 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Balakhilya-das-Facebook-Event-Wix-Event-Instagram-Post-45.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Meditation & Kirtan":MAILTO:hello@davismeditation.com
END:VEVENT
