DESCRIPTION:Come join our weekly Jam Session at Watermelon Music\, hosted by Friends of Watermelon Music. We play a wide array of music\, including classic rock\, contemporary rock\, indie rock\, pop\, folk\, blues\, and much more! All instruments and skill levels welcomed! \nThere is a drum set\, keyboard\, and vocal mic/amp available at the store to play on. Please bring your own amp if you need one. \nWhile technically all ages\, we recommend 18 and over. Attendance is FREE with a suggested donation of $5 to Friends of Watermelon Music.
